OL,3,GNEWSAMen stole #12k of Ann Summers
OL,4,Alingerie and sex toys
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men who stole #12,000 worth of
OL,7,Flingerie and sex toys from an Ann
OL,8,FSummers shop have been sentenced.
OL,10,FPolice were called to reports of a
OL,11,Fburglary in progress at the store in
OL,12,FLong Row in Nottingham city centre at
OL,13,F04:32 BST on 14 August.
OL,15,FNottinghamshire Police said Jason Kamal
OL,16,Fand Ashley Hillsley were detained
OL,17,Fnearby, and a search of Hillsley's car
OL,18,Funcovered a "considerable amount" of
OL,19,FAnn Summers products worth #12,059 in
OL,20,Fthe boot.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
